Closing review round for the first publish to crates.io, PyPI, npm and
Homebrew. Five independent agents read fc62d74, one for each declared
review. Each agent received its criteria, the diff and the repository
path, and nothing from the driver's thread.

Three verdicts are PASS. Two came back FAIL and are declined here, with
the reviewer's own words and the reason, as signoff-driver step 5
sanctions. Both declined findings are recorded in tisket issue ohs7 and
are fixable in a patch release. Neither reaches the irreversible class.

